**File**: `backend/src/collections/dto/patch-collection.dto.ts`

Replace `@IsOptional()` with `@ValidateIf((o) => o.name !== undefined)`:

```typescript
import {
  ValidateIf,
  IsString,
  IsNotEmpty,
  MinLength,
  MaxLength,
} from 'class-validator';

